:4
## -- ends the flags of the root
completion	Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
help	Help about any command
nl	line one
sub	the sub
:4
## -- ends the flags of a child
one
two
tc=-
:4
## -- ends the flag values too
one
two
tc=
:4
## -n=prefix completes the value
-n=alice
-n=bob	the builder
:4
## a cluster completes the value of its last letter
alice
bob	the builder
:4
